{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Idèle"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"Idèle"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>理元 (idèle) 是"},{"Local":{"url":"Adèle","text":"加元 (adèle) 环"}},{"Plain":"的乘法单位元群:\n$$\r\n\\mathbb I = \\mathbb A^\\times.\r\n$$</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>“Idèle” 这个名字由法国数学家 Claude Chevalley 创造, 意为 “理想的元素” (ideal element), 缩写为 id.el. 而 “"},{"Local":{"url":"Adèle","text":"Adèle"}},{"Plain":"” 意为 “加性 idèle” (additive ideal element).</p>\n</blockquote>\n"}]}}